  "gaps": [
    "GET /api/v1/admin/rooms audits target=\"*\" regardless of which tenants the caller could see — audit doesn't capture the actual filter applied.",
    "RoomScopedMetrics.TenantOf is a stringly-typed split on '/' of the room label; fails closed but is a fragile seam vs a typed RoomKey.",
    "Admin list/hottest responses use anonymous objects, inconsistent with the typed ApiContracts used elsewhere.",
    "/sim/telemetry has no auth — gated only by IsDevelopment AND Realtime:EnableDevEndpoints (outside /api/v1 group, so the auth filter never runs). By design."
